    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "專案管理實務應用",
    "sub_ename": "THE PRACTICE OF PROJECT MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "此課程主要是透過系統思考的認識與理解，導引學生進行學習專案管理的實際應用，使其對於專案管理在現實問題的掌握與各種任務達成上，所可以產生的助益有更深的了解，並且可將其運用在實際工作或各種永續問題的解決。",
    "describe_eh": "This course primarily aims to cultivate students' recognition and understanding through systems thinking, guiding them to apply project management principles in practical scenarios. This enables a deeper comprehension of the benefits that project management can bring to solving real-world problems and accomplishing various tasks. Moreover, it facilitates the application of these skills in actual professional settings or towards resolving sustainability issues.",
